Subject: host build: allow selecting which agent harnesses to bundle

Why: cindy-fnos bundles only Pi (plus ripgrep). Claude Code and Codex add
~785 MB on linux-arm64 and are not shipped in the fnOS app. Same code as the
upstream PR (--harnesses, with CINDY_HOST_HARNESSES as fallback).
Upstream: issue https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/10404, PR https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/10418
Remove when: the PR is merged and upstream.lock moves past it.

